DE:
{{TAG:0003:0020:}}Hallo!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Kommst du von außerhalb?{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0023:}}Ich auch.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Das Städtchen hier ist gar
nicht mal so übel.

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Questa città non è affatto malaccio.{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0004:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}Non vorrei esagerare, ma credo
che mi ci sto affezionando!

DE:
{{TAG:0003:000B:}}Ich bin schon weit rumgekommen{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
und ich muss sagen, hier ist es viel
weniger schlimm als anderswo.

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0026:}}I've taken a liking to this town!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}I'm always waiting for something
to inspire me to visit it again!

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0026:}}¡Me está empezando a gustar esto!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Igual me aficiono a venir de vez
en cuando.

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0026:}}Bu kasabayı sevdim!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Tekrar gelmem için beni dürtecek bir şey
çıkmasını bekliyorum hep!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}I didn't do any research or anything
before choosing a place to camp.{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}I think I lucked out with this town!

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Où est-ce que je pourrais faire
construire ma maison ?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} J'ai du pain
sur la planche...{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}} {{TAG:0003:0002:}}HA HA HA !{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Ora devo pensare a dove costruire
casa mia!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Non ero così agitato dal
primo giorno di scuola...{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}} {{TAG:0003:0002:}}AHAHAH!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0006:}}I guess since I'm gonna live here,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}I need to keep an eye open for a
good spot to locate my house!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0006:}}Visto che mi trasferisco qui,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}devo cercarmi un posto adatto
per mettere su le mie quattro mura!

{{TAG:0003:0025:}}{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0011:0000:0000}} mi ha invitato,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} quindi
mi trasferirò qui tra poco tempo.{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0023:}}Preparati ad avermi come vicino!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0011:0000:0000}} sağ olsun beni davet etti,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} ben de yakın
zamanda buraya taşınacağım.{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0023:}}Komşu olacağız!

EN:
The local specialty fruit here is
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}the {{TAG:0005:001A:00CD}}, right?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}That's the same as my own town!
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}It makes it real nice to camp here.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Almost like it's really familiar or
something like that!

IT:
Il frutto locale da queste parti è
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}{{TAG:000E:0001:}}{{TAG:0005:001A:00CD}}, dico bene?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Ma è lo stesso della mia città!
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Ah, che bella sensazione.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Sembra di non essere mai partiti!

DE:
Die örtliche Spezialität hier ist {{TAG:000E:0008:00CD060064006500720006006400690065000600640061007300}}
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}{{TAG:0005:001A:00CD}}, stimmt's?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0023:}}Wie daheim!
{{TAG:0003:0027:}}Deswegen fühlt sich das Campen
hier an, als wäre man zu Hause...{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0002:}}Nur ohne nervige Verwandtschaft!

TRANSLATION:
Buradaki meşhur yerel meyve
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}{{TAG:0005:001A:00CD}}, değil mi?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Benim kasabada da aynı!
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}O yüzden burada kamp yapmak insana pek
tanıdık geliyor.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Neredeyse evimdeymişim gibi!

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0006:}}"Acampar" es un eufemismo para lo
que realmente ocurre aquí dentro:{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
¡es la guerra contra los mosquitos!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:001C:}}Pero yo tengo un secreto,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} ¿quieres
saberlo?{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}} {{TAG:0003:0028:}}¡No uso la violencia!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0023:}}¡Les hago la guerra psicológica!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0006:}}Kamp!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Buna “sivrisineklerle savaş” da
diyebilirsin!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0017:}}
Onlarla nasıl başa çıktığımı bilmek
ister misin?{{TAG:0007:0001:}} {{TAG:0003:0024:}}Hiç!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Oyunlarına gelmem.{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}} {{TAG:0003:0023:}}Bu bir irade savaşı!

ES:
Cuando uno está haciendo turismo,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
lo suyo es probar la comida local.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Por ejemplo, aquí sois expertos
en cocinar {{TAG:0005:001A:00CD}} al horno
y de mil formas más.
¡Está para chuparse los dedos!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}
¡Ojalá tuviera dedos!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}} {{TAG:0003:0002:}}¡Ja, ja, ja!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Kamp yapıyorsan{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} biraz chili yemek şart, değil mi?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}
Benim ev yapımı chili'ye asıl
tekmeyi{{TAG:0005:001A:00CD}} veriyor.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
Güzel oluyor!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}} Hatta, {{TAG:0003:0021:}}en iyisi!

{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Kampın en güzel yanı kesinlikle yediğin yemekler!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0024:}}
Dışarıda yiyince her şey niye
bu kadar daha lezzetli geliyor acaba...

{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Buranın havası nedense bana tanıdık geliyor.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0027:}}
Burada yaşayanlarla da iyi anlaşırım
gibi hissediyorum.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:001A:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}
Biliyor musun, bu kasaba yerleşmek
için hiç fena değil{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:000F:0005:15002800}}
Buraya taşınmalısın!
Burası biraz sıkıcı.
